ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密诉讼</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Midjourney正式发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布全新 Qoder：从 AI 编程 IDE 升级为面向全员的智能体工作台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/09bcf9a64753367ba069c7a1f7b80e38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月27日，阿里正式发布全新 Qoder，将原 AI 编程 IDE 升级为以 Coding 为核心底座的智能体工作台。该平台支持用户通过自然语言描述目标，由系统自主理解上下文、制定计划、调用工具并执行验证。技术层面，Qoder 搭载 Harness 长链路执行底座，实现“读—改—验证—迭代”的自主闭环，具备跨文件编辑、长期记忆及周期提炼技能。模型侧内置海内外 SOTA 模型并深度适配 Qwen 系列，通过 Auto 智能路由平衡效果与成本。产品提供编程与通用双模式，集成 40+ 连接器、70+ 插件及 20K+ 技能，支持 Browser Use 与 Computer Use 操作。交互上新增桌面常驻与语音唤起，实现从“驱动”到“提醒”的范式转变。即日起至9月1日，个人用户可领 2500 Qwen Credit</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯发布770B旗舰模型Hy4preview并正式开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f10b20ccca5c57985cdeb65a0b1f2992.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元团队正式发布全新一代旗舰模型预览版Hy4preview，该模型总参数量达770B，激活参数为49B，支持1M上下文长度。Hy4preview在代码开发、办公分析、游戏原型生成及科学研究等生产力场景表现卓越，内部盲测综合性能优于同类竞品。技术层面，该模型通过优化推理系统，实现端到端吞吐量较基线提升31.8%，并在分子动力学模拟、量子输运器件设计及几何难题求解中取得突破。目前，Hy4preview已全面开源，并上线腾讯云TokenHub与OpenRouter平台，用户可通过元宝、ima等产品体验。该模型将持续与CodeBuddy、WorkBuddy等工具协同，通过广泛的用户反馈加速后续正式版的敏捷迭代。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合苹果前高管向法院申请永久驳回苹果商业秘密诉讼</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cf14f2030f6c7ab1f5117bbe659e7142.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI携手苹果前高管唐坦（Tang Tan）、刘畅（Chang Liu）及io Products，正式向法院提交请愿书，请求“带偏见地驳回”（dismiss with prejudice）苹果公司此前发起的商业秘密窃取诉讼，旨在彻底阻止苹果未来就相同事由再次起诉。此前，苹果指控上述人员在跳槽期间非法获取机密并指导求职者规避安保审查。OpenAI在最新法律回应中指出，苹果的诉状存在根本性事实缺陷，未能根据《保护商业秘密法》（DTSA）清晰界定特定商业秘密或提供确凿的非法挪用证据，仅依赖模糊描述与主观推测。目前双方诉辩状提交已结束，法院定于10月1日召开动议听证会。此案不仅涉及跨公司人才流动与技术合规边界，其最终裁决结果将对硅谷技术人员流动及AI生态中的知识产权保护标准产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Midjourney正式发布V8.2图像编辑模型，支持指令微调与画布扩展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ee1ede5743f536d7e046c8acad8c0b4c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Midjourney近日正式上线V8.2图像编辑模型，标志着其从单一文本生成向精准图像编辑的重大转型。该模型核心支持四大技术特性：一是基于文本指令的图像编辑；二是全新的多图参考机制，单次最多支持融合4张图片；三是局部重绘（inpainting）与画布扩展（outpainting）功能；四是全面兼容个性化设置、情绪板及风格参考（srefs）。用户可通过官网主站、alpha测试网站或Discord频道调用，支持拖拽图片至提示词框或点击“编辑”按钮进行操作。官方表示，该模型目前处于测试初期，针对复杂边缘情况的优化将持续迭代。此次更新旨在为创作者提供更具可控性的专业级视觉创作体验，官方鼓励用户通过任务ID或反馈渠道提交使用建议，以协助开发团队完善功能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布模型硬件标准MHS，正式进军具身智能与物理AI领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c5210c4ae4e9870b5fe8584c0f7bf48.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于8月27日发布研究预览版“模型硬件标准”（MHS），标志其正式切入具身智能与物理AI赛道。MHS本质是一套统一的控制与通信标准，充当AI智能体与物理设备间的“翻译层”，旨在让AI在无需人工干预的情况下，通过可编程接口直接操控显微镜、液体处理器、机械臂及量子计算设备。该标准旨在推动AI从数字对话转向实体产线操作。在早期闭门测试中，MHS表现出显著的提速效应，制药巨头基因泰克通过该标准赋予AI操控异构实验设备的能力，成功将全自动剂量反应曲线实验的开发与运行周期缩短至原来的三分之一。此举意味着AI竞争已从纯软件模型扩展至物理世界的自主执行与持续学习领域，对生物医药、先进制造等硬科技行业具有重要应用价值。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
